   "id": "n1",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "**Legend**\n\n\ud83d\udfe2 Green \u2014 normal action step\n\ud83d\udd35 Blue \u2014 terminal / outcome / report\n\ud83d\udfe3 Purple \u2014 entry / archived / summary\n\ud83d\udfe1 Yellow \u2014 flow start / cross-cutting group\n\ud83d\udfe0 Orange \u2014 decision point / on hold\n\ud83d\udd34 Red \u2014 cancelled / blocking / destructive\n\nFull written step-by-step:\n[[14 System Flowchart]]\n\nv4: same full-coverage audit as v3\n(design-requests & procurement\nmodeled as real state machines;\nno invented \"DCO\" role) \u2014 now\nlaid out as a spaced grid of\nsections instead of one long strip.",
