  },
  {
   "id": "n394",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "**IT Designer:** Sees\nfull inbox, resolves\nor declines (resolution\nnote required to close)",
   "x": 5890.0,
   "y": 11410.0,
   "width": 320,
   "height": 105
  },
  {
   "id": "n397",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "**Any user:** Toggle\nemailOverdueReminders\n(user-settings, default on)\n\u2192 feeds daily overdue job",
   "x": 6460.0,
   "y": 11410.0,
   "width": 320,
   "height": 100
  },
  {
   "id": "n398",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "**Any role:** Live\nnotification feed\n(get/stream/live SSE)",
