   "type": "text",
   "text": "**IT Designer:** View AI\nvalidation config;\n**Admin:** refresh reference\ncost catalog (manual)",
   "x": 1770.0,
   "y": 13700.0,
   "width": 300,
   "height": 90,
   "color": "4"
  },
  {
   "id": "n413",
   "type": "group",
   "label": "IT Designer",
   "x": 2550.0,
   "y": 13445.0,
   "width": 300,
   "height": 300,
   "color": "5"
  },
  {
   "id": "n414",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "\u2022 Manage user accounts\n(create, update, delete)\n\u2022 Manage roles & permissions\n\u2022 Resolve/decline support\nrequests (own inbox hidden)\n\u2022 View audit logs & security\n\u2022 Manage document types\n\u2022 View reconciliation data\n\u2022 View AI validation config",
   "x": 2580.0,
   "y": 13490.0,
   "width": 260,
   "height": 250
  },
  {
   "id": "n415",
   "type": "group",
   "label": "Admin Manager",
   "x": 3120.0,
   "y": 13445.0,
   "width": 300,
   "height": 300,
   "color": "2"
  },
  {
   "id": "n416",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "\u2022 All PM overrides\n\u2022 Archive projects (Admin only)\n\u2022 Manage workflow templates\n\u2022 Override PM approvals\n(needs 10+ char reason)\n\u2022 Approve orders above limit\n\u2022 Trigger design-request sweep\n\u2022 Refresh AI reference catalog",
   "x": 3150.0,
   "y": 13490.0,
   "width": 260,
   "height": 250
  },
  {
   "id": "n417",
   "type": "group",
   "label": "Owner",
   "x": 3690.0,
   "y": 13445.0,
   "width": 300,
   "height": 300,
   "color": "6"
  },
  {
   "id": "n418",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "\u2022 View all dashboards\n(read-only)\n\u2022 Approve purge & legal hold\n\u2022 Owner portfolio view\n\u2022 Owner approval of proposals\n\u2022 Account recovery for\nIT Designer\n\u2022 Design-request attention\ndashboard",
   "x": 3720.0,
   "y": 13490.0,
   "width": 260,
   "height": 250
  },
  {
   "id": "n419",
   "type": "group",
   "label": "Automated Jobs",
   "x": 4260.0,
   "y": 13445.0,
   "width": 300,
   "height": 300,
   "color": "3"
  },
  {
   "id": "n420",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "\u2022 8 advisory signal rules\n(see next section)\n\u2022 Attendance exception\ndetection\n\u2022 Overdue task notifications\n(email, if user opts in)\n\u2022 Design request sweep\n\u2022 Notification delivery\n(server-only, SSE)",
   "x": 4290.0,
   "y": 13490.0,
   "width": 260,
   "height": 250
  },
  {
   "id": "n421",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "**8 Advisory Decision-Support Signals**\n\n1. Cost variance \u2014 actual vs planned budget\n2. Cumulative change impact \u2014 total COs as % of contract\n3. Burn vs progress \u2014 money spent vs % complete\n4. Issue recurrence \u2014 same issue category repeating\n5. Stalled stage \u2014 workflow stuck past threshold\n6. Projected finish \u2014 estimate vs deadline\n7. Overdue tasks \u2014 past due date\n8. Milestone slip \u2014 behind estimated date",
   "x": 5040.0,
   "y": 13445.0,
   "width": 640,
   "height": 280,
   "color": "3"
  },
  {
   "id": "n422",
   "type": "group",
   "label": "Role Action Summary (10 real roles \u2014 no DCO)",
   "x": 0.0,
   "y": 14270.0,
   "width": 660,
   "height": 500,
   "color": "5"
  },
  {
   "id": "n423",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "**Owner** \u2014 read-only all; approves purge/legal hold; design-\nrequest attention dashboard\n\n**Admin** \u2014 overrides, archive, templates, order limit approval,\nsweep job, support inbox fallback\n\n**IT Designer** \u2014 users, roles, audit logs, support requests,\nAI validation config, document types\n\n**Project Manager** \u2014 projects, milestones, phase advance,\ndesign-request send/raise, stakeholders, transmittals\n\n**HR** \u2014 payroll, employee records, attendance, payroll reports\n\n**Finance Manager** \u2014 budgets, purchase requests, orders,\npayments, payroll approval, categories, cash-flow\n\n**Architect** \u2014 proposals, designs, blueprints, design-request\nacknowledge/respond, revisions, architect documents\n\n**Engineer** \u2014 requirements, purchase requests, tasks, issues,\ninspections, design requests (draft), transmittals\n\n**Consultant** \u2014 design/proposal review, design-request\nacknowledge/respond, revision decisions\n\n**Site Personnel** \u2014 task status, attendance, daily reports,\norder delivery (if not PR creator)",
   "x": 30.0,
   "y": 14315.0,
   "width": 620,
   "height": 460
  }
 ],
